            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi @justinmk, sorry for the delay in replying. I've tested again using v0.13.0-dev-2001+g7437121ea3 and the same steps to reproduce the issue, and I can still see the bug.\n\nHere is what I see after pasting the text and pressing `\"`:\n<img width=\"190\" height=\"88\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/216e2bb2-d0f3-4b67-8c1d-36656d914876\" />\n\nAnd here is what I see after pressing Ctrl+L:\n<img width=\"190\" height=\"88\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9e231189-0f47-408f-b294-dde8c37fc51a\" />\n\nPlease let me know if I should test this in a different way or if I'm missing something.",
